$$
\boxed{
\textbf{We should not solve the Kernel yet. We should solve the ontology of Knowledge first.}
}
$$

And the **new `Ideal State` branch is important enough that I would now treat it as a first-class competing historical lineage**, rather than merely another formula for \(K_t\).
